comment = "5BSD capability auth-agent: the identity->capability mint boundary"

desc = <<EOD
authagentd is the system.authagent capability service.  A login program
(login/su/sshd), after authenticating a principal, asks the auth-agent to mint
that session's capability bundle per the principal->bundle policy; the login
program never holds mint authority itself.  See docs/auth-agent-design.md.
EOD
